## 5. Tests

**Dónde:** en la carpeta de tests de la app `rss`, por ejemplo `rss/tests/test_playflows_file_transfer.py`.

```python
from types import SimpleNamespace

from django.test import SimpleTestCase

from rss.management.commands.playflows_rules_categories import get_rule_categories


def build_rule(**overrides):
    values = {
        'fk_rule_content': SimpleNamespace(all=lambda: []),
        'action': 'accept',
        'status': 'enable',
        'hits': 10,
        'fp_rule': False,
        'tag': SimpleNamespace(tag_name='EMEA_UK_PRD_DMZI_PRES_APP'),
        'source': [],
        'destination': [],
        'external_routed': False,
        'file_transfer': False,
    }
    values.update(overrides)
    return SimpleNamespace(**values)


class FileTransferCategoryTests(SimpleTestCase):

    def test_file_transfer_rule_gets_its_own_category(self):
        categories = get_rule_categories(build_rule(file_transfer=True))
        self.assertIn('File Transfer', categories)
        self.assertNotIn('Ext-Routed', categories)

    def test_routed_rule_keeps_ext_routed(self):
        categories = get_rule_categories(build_rule(external_routed=True))
        self.assertIn('Ext-Routed', categories)
        self.assertNotIn('File Transfer', categories)

    def test_regular_rule_has_neither_category(self):
        categories = get_rule_categories(build_rule())
        self.assertNotIn('Ext-Routed', categories)
        self.assertNotIn('File Transfer', categories)
```

**Por qué:** comprueban que las categorías leen bien los flags y que una regla de File Transfer no sale como Ext-Routed. Usan `SimpleNamespace` en lugar de modelos, así que no necesitan base de datos y son rápidos.

```bash
python manage.py test rss.tests.test_playflows_file_transfer
```

